 be destroyed. Although they fight hard, they need more people to join them. They won\u2019t stand for long!\n\nJoin the Arabian Heroes in their battle to save the planet! \n", "short_description": "In the beautiful Arabic desert one day everything changed \u2013 an evil sorcerer released his corrupted crows to invade the planet. Hopefully, the Arabian Heroes family is there to protect and have an unlimited supply of jelly to shoot the crows. But they are coming from everywhere and are harder to defeat!"}]}, "developer_name": "Pixelhunters", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.pixelhunters.com/arabian-heroes-privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "END Entertainment", "support_website_url": "https://www.arabianheroes.com/", "website_url": "https://www.pixelhunters.com/arabian-heroes-vr-game", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["SHOOTER"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "671257710718593"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 3, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "228640075913685"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "720841495748905"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2828934377415037"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "2828934377415037"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1638432000, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "228640075913685"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported